# Docker build context exclusions for the pacgate-ai folder.
#
# The API image build uses context = pacgate-ai (build-ghcr.yml: context:
# pacgate-ai, file: pacgate-ai/Dockerfile). This .dockerignore is read
# RELATIVE TO THE CONTEXT, so paths here are relative to pacgate-ai/.
#
# target/ alone is ~24 GB on this dev box; without this exclusion the
# context transfer alone takes 5+ minutes and can exhaust disk.
#
# NOTE: wasm-crates must stay IN the context - the workspace Cargo.toml
# lists them as members, and cargo refuses to build when a member's
# manifest is missing (verified: excluding wasm-crates/ breaks
# `cargo build --release` with "failed to load manifest for workspace
# member /build/wasm-crates/pacgate-doc-validator").

# Rust build artifacts (never needed in any image build context)
target/

# Local analysis outputs (graphify graph cache, not needed by the image)
graphify-out/

# Design assets (large binary assets, not needed by the API image)
pacgate-ai-assets/